usage: plan.py bridge [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] name [verb] ...

list named bridges or run a bridge verb with its own arguments

positional arguments:
  name                  bridge name, or list
  verb                  bridge verb from its entrypoints
  args                  arguments passed to the bridge verb unchanged

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
